
% Wrecking Ball

a: vi | I | V | ii |
In: vi | I | V | ii |
Vr: $a*2
b: IV | vi | I | IV |
PCh_short: IV | vi | I | IV |
PCh: $b*2
c: I | V | vi | IV |
c_echo: vi | IV |
Ch: $c*2
d: IV | vi | I | iii |
bridge: $d*2
S: [F] $In $Vr $PCh $Ch $c_echo $Vr $PCh $Ch*2 $c_echo $bridge $PCh_short $Ch*2 $c_echo*3
